eceived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Author-checked conditional candidate. Composition of two open lines:** the complex side of #3955 (hosted frame selection, stacked on #3939 → #3934 → … → #3148 → #3133) and the R437 bit supplier of #3647 by @ai-nanachi. #3647 composes the helper464 GL deletion with Ali Romman's #1043 helper470 deletion and adds Sagar Thakrar's #3700 OQ4 slot coalescing. Draft. The full verification run is still going.\n\n| | complex root lower | bit endpoint | binds | κ headline |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| #3955 | 0.0017411725885452521674224 | pooled R438 0.001734900431583947157341 | bit | 0.001734900431583947157341 − … |\n| **this** | 0.0017411725885452521674224 | **R437 0.001736646042038446578551** | **bit** | **0.001736646042038446578551 − 10⁻⁴⁶ − 10⁻⁷⁰** |\n\n**+0.1006% over #3955.** #3955 lifted the complex root about 6.3e-6 above the pooled R438 bit endpoint. #3647's R437 endpoint lies inside that window, so κ rises to it. About 4.5e-6 of complex headroom remains.\n\n### Verification\n`python3 -B research/rank7-frame-select-r437-bit/verify.py` is self-contained, standard library only, and runs in about 2 s.\n- **Complex side:** it re-derives #3955's rank mass, halving guard and 10⁻²⁵ root bracket with its own directed-rounding arithmetic. `RESULT.json` is bound to #3955's committed `AUDIT.json`; #3955's own verifier audits all 521,798 moves.\n- **Bit side:** #3647's `EXPECTED.json` is vendored (head `a24f9ff9`, blob `bc2585e1`; the LF-normalized bytes are SHA-256 bound). Its paid profile is re-priced independently at m = 64, W = 28416, with the inherited 10⁻¹⁶·32m²·N fallback envelope: accepted at c, rejected at c + 10⁻²⁴.\n- **Composition:** κ = min(floor₂₄(complex), c) − 10⁻⁴⁶ − 10⁻⁷⁰, with the bit side binding.\n- **6/6 mutation controls rejected.**\n- **Registered replay:** `PASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE`.\n\n### Scope\nThis inherits every premise of both endpoints:\n- **#3955's complex side:** hosted frame selection, hosted receivers and hosted donors. Native, controller and outer stages were not rerun.\n- **#3647's bit side:** its all-size, SOURCE, COPY, hosting and precision interfaces. Its admission is pending.\n\nThis package re-prices #3647's declared profile; it does not replay #3647's word or hosting. #3700 independently audited the original R437 word.\n\n**Next:** pool R437's own slack across the 32 bit replicas, as #3939 did for R438.\n\nCredit @ai-nanachi (#3647), Ali Romman (#1043), Sagar Thakrar (#3700/#2423) and the full #3955 stack. Complex-side ideas in the stacked predecessors were done with help from OpenCode (Space bunny free). Prepared by Rohan Arun with Anthropic Claude assistance.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011S35E2acyQDaVRjPRw4TDy\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:47:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:47:44Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"20f16c8886410d8c57554e252e4d386908784c66","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"rohanarun:rank7-frame-select-r437","ref":"rank7-frame-select-r437","repo":{"id":1409919887,"node_id":"R_kgDOVAmrjw","name":"integer-mult-bounds","full_name":"rohanarun/integer-mult-bounds","owner":{"login":"rohanarun","id":11659839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjU5ODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11659839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun","html_url":"https://github.com/rohanarun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohanarun/subscriptions","organizations_u